WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.191
No one would have believed in the last years of the nineteenth century that this world was being watched keenly

2
00:00:06.201 --> 00:00:10.723
and closely by intelligences greater than man’s and yet as mortal as his own;

3
00:00:10.733 --> 00:00:15.648
that as men busied themselves about their various concerns they were scrutinised and studied,

4
00:00:15.658 --> 00:00:22.026
perhaps almost as narrowly as a man with a microscope might scrutinise the transient creatures that swarm and multiply in

5
00:00:22.036 --> 00:00:23.178
a drop of water.
